                                                                                        <label for="frm1701:rdoPg2I12AMethodDeductionI" class="iceSelOneRb-dis fieldText1-dis-dis" style="font-size:10px;" >Itemized Deduction<br/> [Sec. 34(A-J), NIRC]</label>
