                                                                                        <label for="frm1701:rdoPg2I12AMethodDeductionO" style="font-size:10px;" >Optional Standard Deduction (OSD) <br/> [40% of Gross Sales/Receipts/Revenues/Fees [Sec. 34(L), NIRC]]</label>
